WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.633
After rehearsing late in the night, our heroes overslept

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.166
and everyone rushed to the Pokémon Showcase venue,

3
00:00:07.233 --> 00:00:09.666
so Serena could register in time.

4
00:00:09.733 --> 00:00:12.533
So, do you think Serena and Shauna made it?

5
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.166
- I'm sure they're just fine.
- Pika!

6
00:00:15.233 --> 00:00:18.600
Though cuttin' it real close like that isn't such a good idea.

7
00:00:18.666 --> 00:00:21.066
How will you make this up to me if I'm too late?

8
00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:24.766
- Buy you a new alarm clock, perhaps?
- Drop it! Let's move!

9
00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:26.100
Wobba, wa, wobb!

10
00:00:26.166 --> 00:00:28.333
Wobba, wa, wobba!

11
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.166
- Pika!
- Hey, guys!

12
00:00:30.233 --> 00:00:34.900
- We got here in the nick of time!
- We're so sorry we made you hurry.

13
00:00:34.966 --> 00:00:36.766
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

14
00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:38.533
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

15
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.966
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

16
00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:43.433
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

17
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:47.266
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

18
00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:50.533
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

19
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.966
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

20
00:00:54.033 --> 00:00:57.933
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

21
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.700
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

22
00:01:02.766 --> 00:01:04.966
♪ Pokémon! ♪

23
00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:10.600
A Performance Pop Quiz!

24
00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:18.066
- Well, off we go!
- Yeah, good luck!

25
00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:20.333
Thanks! One more thing.

26
00:01:22.233 --> 00:01:23.566
Eevee, vee?

27
00:01:25.366 --> 00:01:29.933
- Eevee! Eevee, vee.
- Huh? Are you OK?

28
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.300
Eevee, I'd like you to watch us do our very best, OK?

29
00:01:34.366 --> 00:01:35.533
- Pancham.
- Ee.

30
00:01:36.766 --> 00:01:40.700
- You'll look after Eevee for me, right?
- Sure! Leave it to us.

31
00:01:40.766 --> 00:01:42.300
All right, Bunnelby, come out!

32
00:01:44.033 --> 00:01:46.900
- Please take care of Eevee, OK?
- Bunnelby.

33
00:01:46.966 --> 00:01:49.600
-It's gonna be just fine.

34
00:01:49.666 --> 00:01:52.400
- Let's cheer for Serena together!
- Eevee.

35
00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:55.866
Eevee. Ee.

36
00:01:55.933 --> 00:01:57.633
- Ches!
- Uh! Ah!

37
00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:00.700
-Chespin! Che?

38
00:02:00.766 --> 00:02:04.466
- Pin...
- You know? Chespin never learns...

39
00:02:04.533 --> 00:02:06.433
- Brai, Braixen.
- Pika...

40
00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:11.800
Don't worry about Eevee. You just go and give a great performance.

41
00:02:11.866 --> 00:02:13.100
Mm-hm. Thanks a lot!

42
00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:15.400
Shauna, do your best!

43
00:02:15.466 --> 00:02:18.666
Count on it! You know that's the way I roll!

44
00:02:18.733 --> 00:02:21.266
Eevee, vee, vee.

45
00:02:22.666 --> 00:02:25.566
Ladies and gentlemen! The wait is over!

46
00:02:25.633 --> 00:02:30.466
It's time for an enchanting presentation of performers and their Pokémon!

47
00:02:30.533 --> 00:02:34.966
The Anistar Pokémon Showcase is about to begin!

48
00:02:35.033 --> 00:02:40.100
It is I who will escort you through this lovely dreamworld.

49
00:02:40.166 --> 00:02:43.100
My name? Monsieur Pierre!

50
00:02:43.166 --> 00:02:45.900
You are about to witness an elegant competition

51
00:02:45.966 --> 00:02:49.933
between performers who dream of becoming Kalos Queen!

52
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:53.433
And the winner gets this Princess Key. Magnifique!

53
00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.933
Klefki!

54
00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.800
Huh...

55
00:02:59.266 --> 00:03:00.200
All right!

56
00:03:00.266 --> 00:03:02.966
First, I make it through the Theme Performance.

57
00:03:03.033 --> 00:03:06.000
After that, I win my second Princess Key!

58
00:03:06.066 --> 00:03:09.066
- Not quite. I'm gonna win!
- Huh?

59
00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:13.066
- Nini!
- Serena, dear. Long time!

60
00:03:13.133 --> 00:03:15.866
- Is she a friend of yours?
- Yeah!

61
00:03:15.933 --> 00:03:19.166
- What a nice surprise!
- I didn't know you'd be here.

62
00:03:19.233 --> 00:03:22.333
- Have you won a Princess Key?
- Of course I haven't!

63
00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:26.433
But I'll win it today, so, technically, I already have one.

64
00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.666
I'm going to show you an incredible performance.

65
00:03:29.733 --> 00:03:32.066
Hey, you're the Shauna?

66
00:03:32.133 --> 00:03:35.566
It was so fun watching the video of your winning performance!

67
00:03:35.633 --> 00:03:38.666
- You were wonderful!
- Thanks so much! That's nice of you.

68
00:03:38.733 --> 00:03:43.533
I'm sorry, but I'm going to walk away from this Pokémon Showcase the big winner.

69
00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:46.700
Good luck! Let's both do the very best we can!

70
00:03:46.766 --> 00:03:48.166
Right!

71
00:03:48.233 --> 00:03:50.900
Pancham, cham, cham... Cham?

72
00:03:50.966 --> 00:03:52.733
Smooch!

73
00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:55.266
- Cham! Pancham!
- Smooch!

74
00:03:55.333 --> 00:04:00.200
How cute! It's easy to see how my Smoochum has really been missing your Pancham.

75
00:04:00.266 --> 00:04:02.800
- Yeah. I guess so.
- They're so friendly!

76
00:04:02.866 --> 00:04:06.866
Aw! That sweetie-pie Smoochum is still as cute as ever!

77
00:04:06.933 --> 00:04:09.933
- All right, Nini, Lilly, and Serena.
- Huh?

78
00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.866
You'll all be up very shortly! Right!

79
00:04:12.933 --> 00:04:15.466
It looks like it won't be long now.

80
00:04:15.533 --> 00:04:19.233
- Good luck, Serena! Nini, you too!
- Mm-hm.

81
00:04:20.366 --> 00:04:25.666
The Theme Performance for this showcase is... a Pokémon quiz!

82
00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:29.833
Pika?

83
00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:32.533
I didn't know a Pokémon Showcase could have quizzes.

84
00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.533
It sounds like a battle of intellect.

85
00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:39.033
Not only does the Kalos Queen have to be beautiful,

86
00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:41.533
she must also be intelligent.

87
00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:46.533
Beauty and intellect, both are necessary to become Queen.

88
00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:51.000
Only those performers who correctly answer three questions

89
00:04:51.066 --> 00:04:54.100
will then move along to the Freestyle Performance.

90
00:04:54.166 --> 00:04:57.500
- Makes sense.
- Hm. That sounds hard.

91
00:04:57.566 --> 00:04:59.600
- That's not all!
- Huh?

92
00:04:59.666 --> 00:05:02.700
It's the performer who will answer the question,

93
00:05:02.766 --> 00:05:06.400
but it's her Pokémon who will have to win her that chance!

94
00:05:06.466 --> 00:05:10.666
Performer and Pokémon, working together to dominate the stage!

95
00:05:10.733 --> 00:05:13.666
- Sounds like fun!
- Denne-ne!

96
00:05:13.733 --> 00:05:17.433
And now, it's time to give a big round of applause

97
00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:23.166
to your first group of performers!

98
00:05:23.233 --> 00:05:25.833
- Look, it's Serena!
- Wow, she's up first!

99
00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:29.000
Hey, look. Isn't that Nini standing next to Serena?

100
00:05:29.066 --> 00:05:30.666
You're right!

101
00:05:30.733 --> 00:05:34.900
- Is Nini your friend, too?
- Yeah, you betcha!

102
00:05:34.966 --> 00:05:41.100
And now, our first trio of performers must win the chance to answer

103
00:05:41.166 --> 00:05:43.633
in the Stone Trial!

104
00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:48.066
The performers' Pokémon retrieve a ball from inside one of three boulders.

105
00:05:48.133 --> 00:05:50.666
The Pokémon who returns the quickest earns the chance

106
00:05:50.733 --> 00:05:52.700
for its performer to answer the question!

107
00:05:52.766 --> 00:05:55.433
- Cham, cham.
- I'm counting on you, Pancham!

108
00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.966
This will be a piece of cake for my Farfetch'd.

109
00:05:58.033 --> 00:05:58.933
Farfetch'd.

110
00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.233
- You can do it, Solrock.
- Sol!

111
00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:08.533
All right, my friends! Let's get underway with round one of our Theme Performance!

112
00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.366
Quiz Time!

113
00:06:15.066 --> 00:06:20.000
Eevee has many evolved forms. Name its Fairy-type Evolution!

114
00:06:20.066 --> 00:06:23.266
- Hm.
- Ready? Go!

115
00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:25.500
- Pancham!
- Farfetch'd!

116
00:06:25.566 --> 00:06:29.533
Pan... Pancham! Pan! Cham, cham, cham, cham, cham, cham!

117
00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:31.766
Far!

118
00:06:31.833 --> 00:06:33.633
-Cham, cham, cham!

119
00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:37.200
Who will win the chance to answer the question?

120
00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:40.200
Cham!

121
00:06:40.266 --> 00:06:41.833
- Far!
- Look!

122
00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:45.800
Serena's Pancham is first to retrieve the ball!

123
00:06:45.866 --> 00:06:47.933
- Farfetch'd!
- And close behind...

124
00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.600
- All right!
- Farfetch'd!

125
00:06:49.666 --> 00:06:52.233
- All right, Pancham, way to go!
- Pika!

126
00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.066
- Cham, cham, cham!
- Far, Farfetch'd.

127
00:06:54.133 --> 00:06:55.533
-No, Pancham!

128
00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.933
- Far, far!
- Cham, cham, cham, cham.

129
00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:00.866
- You can do it!
- I know you can catch up!

130
00:07:00.933 --> 00:07:02.000
-Step on it!

131
00:07:02.066 --> 00:07:03.633
- Far, far!
- Pancham, Pancham...

132
00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:06.133
Farfetch'd!

133
00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:07.966
- A close finish.

134
00:07:08.033 --> 00:07:10.800
But Nini gets to answer the question!

135
00:07:10.866 --> 00:07:13.233
So, Nini, if you please...

136
00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:15.833
- Pan, pan.
- Don't you worry, Pancham.

137
00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:17.100
You were amazing!

138
00:07:17.166 --> 00:07:19.433
Let's see...

139
00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.300
The answer is... Espeon!

140
00:07:22.366 --> 00:07:23.966
-Oh!

141
00:07:24.033 --> 00:07:26.266
- Far...
- I'm afraid not.

142
00:07:26.333 --> 00:07:30.966
Espeon is a Psychic type. Which gives Serena the chance to steal!

143
00:07:31.033 --> 00:07:34.700
Huh? All right. The answer is Sylveon!

144
00:07:34.766 --> 00:07:38.700
- Correct! Très bien!

145
00:07:38.766 --> 00:07:41.566
- All right!
- What a relief!

146
00:07:41.633 --> 00:07:43.800
- Pancham!
- Braixen, brai!

147
00:07:43.866 --> 00:07:46.666
Alors, question two!

148
00:07:46.733 --> 00:07:52.233
Gloom has two evolved forms. Vileplume and what else?

149
00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:56.300
- Farfetch'd.
- Pancham, cham, cham, cham!

150
00:07:56.366 --> 00:07:59.066
- Farfetch'd. Farfetch'd.
- Pancham, cham, cham, cham!

151
00:07:59.133 --> 00:08:01.066
Cham!

152
00:08:01.133 --> 00:08:04.100
This time, it's Serena!

153
00:08:04.166 --> 00:08:06.333
It's Bellossom!

154
00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:07.733
Correct!

155
00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:12.066
- Hm! Don't be too sure of yourself!
- Give it your best shot!

156
00:08:12.133 --> 00:08:15.566
Which Pokémon weighs more, Exploud or Ursaring?

157
00:08:15.633 --> 00:08:16.933
Far!

158
00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.466
Ursaring!

159
00:08:19.533 --> 00:08:23.733
The Pokémon Trevenant has two types. One is Grass and the other...

160
00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:25.233
Pancham!

161
00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:28.066
A Ghost type!

162
00:08:28.133 --> 00:08:29.466
-I did it!

163
00:08:29.533 --> 00:08:33.400
And Serena moves on to the Freestyle Performance stage!

164
00:08:33.466 --> 00:08:35.400
- All right!
- Yippee, yay!

165
00:08:35.466 --> 00:08:38.900
- That's one down, one more to go!
- I'm impressed!

166
00:08:38.966 --> 00:08:42.066
Bunnelby!

167
00:08:43.966 --> 00:08:45.866
Nice job, Serena.

168
00:08:45.933 --> 00:08:50.433
I know I didn't win, but I hope that you'll win this one for both of us.

169
00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:51.866
Thanks a lot, Nini!

170
00:08:51.933 --> 00:08:54.866
- Smoochum!
- Pancham!

171
00:08:56.166 --> 00:08:58.700
- Alors, the next question!
- Huh?

172
00:08:58.766 --> 00:09:02.266
What berry cures a poisoned Pokémon?

173
00:09:08.633 --> 00:09:10.700
Saur!

174
00:09:10.766 --> 00:09:13.300
Now the answer, s'il vous plaît!

175
00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:17.300
Pecha Berry!

176
00:09:17.366 --> 00:09:22.300
And Shauna is a Theme Performance Stage winner as well!

177
00:09:22.366 --> 00:09:23.800
She's amazing!

178
00:09:23.866 --> 00:09:25.900
That means we'll get to see Serena and Shauna

179
00:09:25.966 --> 00:09:28.566
show what they can do in a Freestyle Performance!

180
00:09:28.633 --> 00:09:31.400
- Yippee!
- No surprise.

181
00:09:31.466 --> 00:09:33.300
- It's them, after all.
- Pika!

182
00:09:33.366 --> 00:09:35.966
Eevee!

183
00:09:36.033 --> 00:09:38.666
Who's that Pokémon?

184
00:09:43.033 --> 00:09:45.600
It's Gloom!

185
00:09:46.866 --> 00:09:48.966
Gloom.

186
00:09:50.666 --> 00:09:54.133
Oy vey. How did I get stuck with this gig?

187
00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:57.533
One more question! Grab that ball or else!

188
00:09:57.600 --> 00:10:01.200
Come on! Pokémon aren't tools, you know.

189
00:10:01.266 --> 00:10:02.766
- Sneasel!
- No way!

190
00:10:02.833 --> 00:10:05.533
If Jessie gets any more upset, I'm toast!

191
00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:09.366
-Sneasel!

192
00:10:09.433 --> 00:10:12.000
The answer is Confuse Ray!

193
00:10:12.066 --> 00:10:14.366
Incroyable!

194
00:10:14.433 --> 00:10:18.866
And that means Jessilee will move on to the Freestyle Performance Stage!

195
00:10:18.933 --> 00:10:21.033
Yes! I did it!

196
00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:24.300
- Go, Jessilee!
- Wobba, wobba!

197
00:10:24.366 --> 00:10:26.500
No surprise here!

198
00:10:26.566 --> 00:10:28.900
-I did it!

199
00:10:28.966 --> 00:10:32.100
Congratulations!

200
00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:35.866
- 'Kay, it's finally time!
- Pika, pika.

201
00:10:35.933 --> 00:10:38.666
Soon we'll be watching the Freestyle Performance Stage.

202
00:10:42.233 --> 00:10:45.300
Don't forget, there'll be no holding back from me!

203
00:10:46.566 --> 00:10:47.800
Or from me!

204
00:10:50.866 --> 00:10:55.233
And now, it's time for the Freestyle Performance Stage,

205
00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:58.266
where the winners from the Theme Performance Stage compete.

206
00:10:58.333 --> 00:11:02.833
And what's more, you lovely people will be our judges!

207
00:11:03.833 --> 00:11:06.933
Please cast your votes using the Glow Casters,

208
00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:10.133
after all the performances have concluded.

209
00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:14.366
So get ready for sublime performances!

210
00:11:14.433 --> 00:11:17.433
First up, it's Shauna!

211
00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:20.700
- Wow, Shauna's up first!
- You can do it, Shauna!

212
00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:26.466
- All right. Flabébé, Fairy Wind!
- Flabé!

213
00:11:26.533 --> 00:11:29.766
- Ivysaur, Vine Whip!
- Saur, saur!

214
00:11:32.766 --> 00:11:34.500
- Che!
- Look at that. Pretty!

215
00:11:34.566 --> 00:11:38.100
Of course it's pretty. They've been rehearsing 24-seven!

216
00:11:40.666 --> 00:11:44.200
Shauna's amazing, for sure. But I have to beat her

217
00:11:44.266 --> 00:11:46.600
if I wanna get up on the same stage as Aria!

218
00:11:46.666 --> 00:11:49.700
Brai... Braixen!

219
00:11:49.766 --> 00:11:51.966
- Huh?
- Pancham!

220
00:11:52.033 --> 00:11:55.833
Huh? Yeah, you're right, Pancham! Let's make sure everyone knows

221
00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:58.033
we're giving it all we've got in our performance!

222
00:11:58.100 --> 00:11:58.933
- Braixen!
- Pancham!

223
00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:06.966
That's all!

224
00:12:09.766 --> 00:12:16.300
And next up, prepare yourselves for the beautiful and talented Jessilee!

225
00:12:16.366 --> 00:12:17.966
-What in the world?

226
00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:26.933
Hm!

227
00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.800
Hm! Mm!

228
00:12:28.866 --> 00:12:31.300
- Looks pretty cool.
- Pika.

229
00:12:31.366 --> 00:12:34.800
Aaaah! Use Seed Bomb!

230
00:12:34.866 --> 00:12:37.200
Gour-ga-ga-ga-ga-geist!

231
00:12:41.766 --> 00:12:43.600
- Eevee!
- Bunn?

232
00:12:45.733 --> 00:12:49.266
Eevee! Eevee! Eev, eev, eev...

233
00:12:49.333 --> 00:12:50.766
Eevee! Eevee...

234
00:12:50.833 --> 00:12:52.566
What a surprise, huh, Dedenne?

235
00:12:52.633 --> 00:12:55.266
- Bunn! Bunnelby!
- Hey, what's wrong, Bunnelby?

236
00:12:55.333 --> 00:12:57.266
Bunn, Bunnelby! Bunn, Bunnelby!

237
00:12:57.333 --> 00:12:58.366
-Pika?

238
00:12:58.433 --> 00:12:59.766
- Eevee's missing?
- Bunnelby!

239
00:13:01.666 --> 00:13:03.000
- Eevee!
- Huh?

240
00:13:03.066 --> 00:13:05.733
Eeeve!

241
00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.766
Vee, vee!

242
00:13:07.833 --> 00:13:11.800
Ee... ee... ee...

243
00:13:18.733 --> 00:13:23.100
- Excuse me! Did you see an Eevee?
- Eevee?

244
00:13:23.166 --> 00:13:24.633
No, I'm sorry. I haven't.

245
00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:25.833
Huh? Ash? What's up?

246
00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:28.933
Serena! I'm sorry, but we don't know where Eevee is!

247
00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:30.100
Oh, no!

248
00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:33.600
- Please let me look!
- Eevee?

249
00:13:33.666 --> 00:13:38.100
Eevee must be petrified! I'm sure it's waiting for me!

250
00:13:38.166 --> 00:13:42.433
But if you miss your performance, I'm afraid you'll be disqualified.

251
00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.100
Uh! No way!

252
00:13:44.166 --> 00:13:46.366
You should go and get up on that stage.

253
00:13:46.433 --> 00:13:49.233
- I'll find Eevee. I promise!
- He's right!

254
00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:51.600
You've been rehearsing so hard for this moment!

255
00:13:51.666 --> 00:13:55.566
- But I can't! I'm worried about Eevee!
- Eevee!

256
00:13:55.633 --> 00:13:57.466
- Serena...
- Hold on.

257
00:13:57.533 --> 00:14:00.366
Let me find out if they'll change it so you can go last.

258
00:14:00.433 --> 00:14:02.866
- I'll do what I can, OK?
- Thank you so much.

259
00:14:02.933 --> 00:14:04.800
I'm so sorry for this!

260
00:14:04.866 --> 00:14:07.666
- Braixen, Pancham, let's go!
- Huh?

261
00:14:07.733 --> 00:14:09.833
- Brai, brai!
- Cham, cham!

262
00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:11.833
- Eevee!

263
00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:14.400
- Braixen!
- Pancham!

264
00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:17.566
- Eevee? Please, where are you?
- Eevee!

265
00:14:17.633 --> 00:14:20.166
- Pika!
- Ches!

266
00:14:20.233 --> 00:14:21.300
By, by!

267
00:14:21.366 --> 00:14:23.800
Eevee.

268
00:14:23.866 --> 00:14:26.333
Ee. Eevee.

269
00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:29.333
Eevee... Eevee.

270
00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:31.833
- Hey! Eevee?
- Eevee!

271
00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:33.900
Eevee.

272
00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:36.366
Eevee?

273
00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:39.366
Ee... Eevee!

274
00:14:39.433 --> 00:14:41.066
Eevee!

275
00:14:42.066 --> 00:14:45.200
- Huh? There you are, Eevee!
- Ee, ee, ee!

276
00:14:45.266 --> 00:14:48.833
Aw! Oh, thank goodness! Where have you been?

277
00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:53.266
- Eevee!
- I was so worried about you, Eevee.

278
00:14:53.333 --> 00:14:55.000
Eevee! Ee, vee, vee!

279
00:14:55.066 --> 00:14:58.133
- Eevee! Eevee, Eevee!
- Huh?

280
00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:01.600
I think Eevee's telling you to go give your performance.

281
00:15:01.666 --> 00:15:04.066
- Eevee!
- Yeah, Eevee's right!

282
00:15:04.133 --> 00:15:06.700
I'll keep a closer eye on Eevee from now on.

283
00:15:06.766 --> 00:15:07.600
- Pikachu!
- Bunn!
- Chespin.

284
00:15:08.666 --> 00:15:11.866
- Thanks, you guys.
- Serena, did you find Eevee?

285
00:15:11.933 --> 00:15:14.700
We sure did! Hm.

286
00:15:15.733 --> 00:15:18.166
- Here I go, Eevee!
- Eevee!

287
00:15:18.233 --> 00:15:20.533
Eevee.

288
00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:24.533
Now, for our last performance of the competition!

289
00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:29.066
So let's all make her feel at home! Welcome, Serena!

290
00:15:36.633 --> 00:15:38.800
-Pika!

291
00:15:38.866 --> 00:15:41.033
Eevee!

292
00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:44.766
And here we go!

293
00:15:45.833 --> 00:15:49.766
Braixen!

294
00:15:49.833 --> 00:15:52.000
Brai, brai, Braixen!

295
00:15:52.066 --> 00:15:55.633
- Now, Pancham, Arm Thrust!
- Cham, cham, Pancham!

296
00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:58.133
Pancham! Cham!

297
00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:00.433
Braixen!

298
00:16:04.266 --> 00:16:05.700
Hm!

299
00:16:05.766 --> 00:16:10.833
You see, Eevee? I want to try that dance you did at tomorrow's Free Performance.

300
00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:12.800
- Braix.
- Cham.

301
00:16:12.866 --> 00:16:16.100
It would be amazing if you could teach us how to dance like you do!

302
00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:18.733
Eevee!

303
00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:21.233
- Let's do it!
- Pancham, Pancham!

304
00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:24.900
- Braixen, Braixen! Brai!
- Pancham! Pan!

305
00:16:24.966 --> 00:16:26.866
Eevee!

306
00:16:28.833 --> 00:16:31.266
- It's brilliant!
- This is so much fun!

307
00:16:31.333 --> 00:16:34.266
- You bet!
- Serena makes me want to dance, too!

308
00:16:34.333 --> 00:16:36.800
Pancham!

309
00:16:41.933 --> 00:16:43.533
Pancham!

310
00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:47.966
Braixen!

311
00:16:48.033 --> 00:16:52.400
Brai! Brai! Braixen!

312
00:16:52.466 --> 00:16:54.733
Brai!

313
00:16:58.766 --> 00:17:00.500
- Wow.
- Pika.

314
00:17:00.566 --> 00:17:02.266
Eevee.

315
00:17:08.166 --> 00:17:10.466
Please light your Glow Casters

316
00:17:10.533 --> 00:17:13.133
using the corresponding colour of the performer

317
00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:15.766
you thought gave the best performance!

318
00:17:15.833 --> 00:17:18.266
All right. If you please!

319
00:17:32.233 --> 00:17:36.133
Good, good, good!

320
00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:47.433
And now! The winner of the Anistar Pokémon Showcase is...

321
00:17:48.433 --> 00:17:51.200
- Serena!

322
00:17:51.266 --> 00:17:54.100
Yeah! We did it! Yay!

323
00:17:54.166 --> 00:17:57.333
- Yeah! That's her second win!
- Pikachu!

324
00:17:57.400 --> 00:18:02.300
You were great, Serena! Congratulations on a wonderful performance!

325
00:18:02.366 --> 00:18:03.400
Thank you, Shauna!

326
00:18:03.466 --> 00:18:07.400
My not being the winner is not an option!

327
00:18:07.466 --> 00:18:11.900
- Wobb... Wobba, wobba!

328
00:18:11.966 --> 00:18:14.766
Congratulations on being our winner!

329
00:18:14.833 --> 00:18:18.466
We are happy to present you with the beautiful Princess Key.

330
00:18:18.533 --> 00:18:20.966
Key! Klefki!

331
00:18:21.033 --> 00:18:24.466
Aaah! Mm!

332
00:18:24.533 --> 00:18:28.733
Ah! ♪ Ta-da! ♪ The Princess Key! We did it!!

333
00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:30.966
- Braixen!
- Cha! Pancham!

334
00:18:31.033 --> 00:18:35.533
And we come to the end of the Anistar City Pokémon Showcase!

335
00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:40.100
Thank you all for coming! Au revoir, mes amis, until next time!

336
00:18:43.533 --> 00:18:45.866
Eevee!

337
00:18:45.933 --> 00:18:49.700
Did you watch us? Did you think that all of that rehearsing paid off?

338
00:18:49.766 --> 00:18:52.466
- Eevee!
- That was a great performance, Serena.

339
00:18:52.533 --> 00:18:54.133
- So cool!
- Pika, pika!

340
00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:56.633
Watching you made me want to dance, too!

341
00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:59.533
Your excellent performance totally got me in the groove!

342
00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:02.766
- You've got two Princess Keys!
- Mm-hm.

343
00:19:02.833 --> 00:19:04.633
One more, and I'll be in the Master Class!

344
00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.866
Eevee! Vee!

345
00:19:06.933 --> 00:19:12.100
- As for you, let's perform together!
- Eevee, vee, vee!

346
00:19:12.166 --> 00:19:16.500
Give me a break! The people in Kalos have absolutely no taste!

347
00:19:16.566 --> 00:19:19.333
- Zero! Nada!
- What do we do now?

348
00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:22.200
Jess? Don't forget, they still voted you third place!

349
00:19:22.266 --> 00:19:25.566
Huh! You're right! Here's the plan.

350
00:19:25.633 --> 00:19:29.000
- We'll go work on my routine!
- Again, already?

351
00:19:29.066 --> 00:19:32.266
The next win is all mine!

352
00:19:32.333 --> 00:19:33.933
- Wobba!
- Team Rocket!

353
00:19:39.333 --> 00:19:41.066
Wow! So pretty!

354
00:19:42.533 --> 00:19:46.300
- Chespin, che!
- Now we both have two Princess Keys.

355
00:19:46.366 --> 00:19:49.366
- One to go!
- Mm-hm. I'm not going to lose!

356
00:19:49.433 --> 00:19:52.466
- All right, Ash. Your turn next!
- Awesome!

357
00:19:52.533 --> 00:19:56.200
I'm gonna beat the Anistar Gym and win another Kalos Gym Badge!

358
00:19:56.266 --> 00:19:57.100
Pikachu!

359
00:19:57.166 --> 00:20:00.000
- So why don't we go to the gym tomorrow?
- Great idea!

360
00:20:00.066 --> 00:20:03.000
- Shauna! Emergency!
- What, Tierno?

361
00:20:03.066 --> 00:20:06.466
Trevor was so preoccupied taking pictures, he misplaced his stuff

362
00:20:06.533 --> 00:20:09.133
- and he doesn't even know where!
- Oh, no!

363
00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:12.533
- Man, what was he thinking?
- That's just Trevor being Trevor.

364
00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:14.900
So I'm gonna go right now and help him look for it.

365
00:20:14.966 --> 00:20:17.133
OK. I can help you as well.

366
00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:20.966
Sorry to rush off like this, but I'll catch you all soon! Later!

367
00:20:21.033 --> 00:20:22.133
Bye!

368
00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:24.866
- Lots of luck, Ash!
- Hm.

369
00:20:24.933 --> 00:20:25.966
See you, Serena!

370
00:20:28.266 --> 00:20:32.633
- Take care! Tell Trevor we say hi!
- Pika, pika!

371
00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:36.266
Serena has won the Anistar City Pokémon Showcase

372
00:20:36.333 --> 00:20:39.033
and now has her second Princess Key!

373
00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:42.900
So, will Ash be able to win his seventh Kalos Gym Badge?

374
00:20:42.966 --> 00:20:46.800
The answer to come, as the journey continues!
